feat: configurable theme, no copyright line, metadata fetched in the browser

config.json now also drives the look:
- primaryColor: keeps the hand-tuned green palette as-is for the default, and
  derives on-primary / containers / secondary / tertiary for any other colour
  (src/utils/theme.js: contrast, tinting, hue rotation)
- backgroundColor / backgroundColorDark: page base colour per theme
- backgroundImage + backgroundOpacity: fixed full-viewport wallpaper; the app
  shell goes transparent and <body> keeps the theme colour as the image base
- icon: favicon + admin brand mark (URL or data URI)
- footerNote: empty now hides the whole line (no hard-coded 版权所有)

Publishing no longer depends on the server reaching Bilibili:
- the admin page fetches the video with JSONP in the *browser* (your own IP) and
  posts the raw payload to /api/videos/import, where normalizeFromView() turns it
  into a record — the server never talks to Bilibili (this is what makes Vercel's
  412 ban irrelevant). Refresh / hydrate use the same path; a failed browser
  fetch falls back to the server once. Tags cannot be fetched this way (B站
  requires Referer bilibili.com for /view/detail, and Chromium blocks the 403
  HTML with ORB) — documented in the UI and the tutorial.

Also: /api/config (2), GET /api/config + views-channel assertions in api-check
(58 → 66), local-fetch + appearance assertions in interaction-check (60 → 67),
TUTORIAL/README updated.
